                "text": "I\u2019m looking forward to joining @NewDemCoalition live on the Fly In Podcast today with @RepVeasey and @RepGregLandsman. Tune in to watch live in an hour, at 1:30 PM Eastern. We\u2019ll be discussing this Republican shutdown, soaring healthcare costs, Trump\u2019s latest, and more.\nhttps://t.co/HqEetWS5Uz",
