                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Americans cannot afford this Republican agenda. Even Rep. Marjorie Taylor Greene knows how much her party is going to hurt everyday Americans. That\u2019s why I am fighting for affordable healthcare and to lower costs for you. https://t.co/fwPoGjSYOC",
