                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The scariest thing this Halloween is the fact that Republicans want to rip away healthcare from millions of Americans and take food out of the mouths of hungry children. This is a full-blown nightmare. https://t.co/eFvTAzo8Aq",
