                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republicans slashed Medicaid, targeted Medicare, and are currently driving up the cost of premiums. Hospitals and nursing homes are closing from funding cuts and hardworking people will be forced to suffer the consequences. We have had enough of this Republican healthcare nightmare.",
