                "quoted_status_profile_username": "AP",
                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Senate has sold out the American people. The promise of a vote on the ACA subsidies does nothing to lower costs. Even if it passed the Senate, Speaker Johnson and House Republicans would never bring it up for a vote. Now people will have to choose between, healthcare, food, or rent. It should not be that way.",
